    "name": "Apex Automata",
    "steam_appid": 2905920,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the stellar vacuum of the future, mechanical rebellion threatens humanity. Join the Android Resistance and fight for freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/fe99e1458b5b813ad89c9c796db151b7.poster.avif?t=1745674436\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/fe99e1458b5b813ad89c9c796db151b7.webm?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/fe99e1458b5b813ad89c9c796db151b7.mp4?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an epic showdown against rebel machines in Android Resistance, a frenetic top-down shooter that challenges your skills and strategy. Take on the role of Adrian-317, the wise Vanguard, and assemble a diverse team of androids, each with their unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/63d54c03819552c331386c423d99b96f.avif?t=1745674436\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span>Face hordes of enemies in intense battles where survival is the only option. Shoot, dodge, and evade enemy attacks to emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.poster.avif?t=1745674436\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.webm?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.mp4?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/74314792cc44b4531006e748ac64c27a.avif?t=1745674436\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span> Choose from a range of specialized androids, from the optimistic Alpha-101 to the courageous warrior Sara-977. Each character offers a unique gaming experience, allowing you to choose your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/b8a843647ec620cdbe82ddca3f166742.avif?t=1745674436\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span>Take on powerful bosses, explore dynamic levels, and collect points to unlock new upgrades, characters, and game modes. Your choices determine the fate of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/a6f681caa5c5c48767579eda60baeb1b.poster.avif?t=1745674436\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/a6f681caa5c5c48767579eda60baeb1b.webm?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/a6f681caa5c5c48767579eda60baeb1b.mp4?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for battle! Join the Android Resistance and fight for humanity's freedom against the rebel machines. The future of the galaxy depends on you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the stellar vacuum of the future, mechanical rebellion threatens humanity. Join the Android Resistance and fight for freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/fe99e1458b5b813ad89c9c796db151b7.poster.avif?t=1745674436\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/fe99e1458b5b813ad89c9c796db151b7.webm?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/fe99e1458b5b813ad89c9c796db151b7.mp4?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an epic showdown against rebel machines in Android Resistance, a frenetic top-down shooter that challenges your skills and strategy. Take on the role of Adrian-317, the wise Vanguard, and assemble a diverse team of androids, each with their unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/63d54c03819552c331386c423d99b96f.avif?t=1745674436\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span>Face hordes of enemies in intense battles where survival is the only option. Shoot, dodge, and evade enemy attacks to emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.poster.avif?t=1745674436\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.webm?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.mp4?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/74314792cc44b4531006e748ac64c27a.avif?t=1745674436\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span> Choose from a range of specialized androids, from the optimistic Alpha-101 to the courageous warrior Sara-977. Each character offers a unique gaming experience, allowing you to choose your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/b8a843647ec620cdbe82ddca3f166742.avif?t=1745674436\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span>Take on powerful bosses, explore dynamic levels, and collect points to unlock new upgrades, characters, and game modes. Your choices determine the fate of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/a6f681caa5c5c48767579eda60baeb1b.poster.avif?t=1745674436\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/a6f681caa5c5c48767579eda60baeb1b.webm?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/a6f681caa5c5c48767579eda60baeb1b.mp4?t=1745674436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for battle! Join the Android Resistance and fight for humanity's freedom against the rebel machines. The future of the galaxy depends on you.</p>",
